window.products.push({"id":110017,"name":"LeafLoveLife-Stainless Steel Pour Over Coffee Maker with Stand - Paperless Reusable Drip Brewer Cone Coffee Filter - Includes Bonus Coffee Scoop with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mwiI6U3lL._AC_SL1233_.jpg","description":"★ Replace your coffee paper filters and start brewing tastier coffee with our double mesh stainless steel coffee dripper by LeafLoveLife ★ Great Money Saver and Environmental Protection We figured that using disposable paper filters for coffee cost more than $400 annually and reduce the taste of coffee by adsorbing the essential oils and nutrients benefits coffee offers, not only has a high yearly cost for your pocket, but it creates a lot of waste and pollution that affect our environment. We designed an exclusive premium pour over coffee dripper made of stainless steel that will last a lifetime. The LeafLoveLife coffee filter is a very versatile coffee tool designed for coffee enthusiast. It can fit most cups, mugs, thermoses, small pots and even carafe. The ultra fine double mesh will give you a perfect morning cup of coffee to start the day. Simply place the stainless steel coffee dripper on top of your favorite cup and add 2 spoons of freshly ground coffee, pour hot water, and you will have a pure tasty coffee with all the nutrients and oils in no time. Take your coffee dripper anywhere you go The lightweight, portable and compact design makes it easy to carry in your baggage or backpack. You can use it at work, set it up while camping, or enjoy it in your own kitchen, balcony and much more. Wherever you intend to use this premium coffee filter, it will provide a tastier cup of coffee. What’s In The Box? ✔ 1 x Stainless Steel Coffee Dripper✔ 1 x Coffee Spoon with Built-In Bag Clip 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE Your satisfaction is what drives us to provide the highest quality kitchen products on the market. If at any time you are not completely satisfied with your purchase feel free to return it to us for a full and prompt refund. Click the Add to Cart button and ORDER NOW your LeafLoveLife coffee filter TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mwiI6U3lL._AC_SL1233_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeafLoveLife","source_asin":"B06XK5H8V6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XK5H8V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XK5H8V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
