window.products.push({"id":110069,"name":"Countertop Dishwasher, GASLAND Chef DW102WN Portable Dishwasher With Built in Water Tank 7.5L, 360°Dual Spray Arms, 5 in 1 Multifunctional Dishwasher,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b4l8-8N5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🎁【Compact & Portable】The portable dishwasher measures 17.87×16.26×19.33 inches (included 7.5 liter water tank), it can holds 3 sets of tableware and fits up to 12-inches dishes in diameter at an angle. Mini size perfect for small houses, dorms, apartments and more. At the same time, the portable design allows to take it to anywhere, it is the ideal choice for campers and RVs. 🎁【160℉ High-Temperature Clean】 This compact dishwasher heats up the water to 160℉ while washing the dishes. 99.99% stubborn stains can be removed. This counter dishwasher included a large transparent glass window so that the washing process is clear at a glance.The 3 layers filtration system can effectively filter the food debris that falls during the cleaning process and avoid clogging the drains. 🎁【5 Washing Programs】The GASLAND Chef tabletop dishwasher comes with 5 washing programs - ECO, Normal, Intensive, Rapid and Glass. One touch control to choose the suitable function according to the smudgy degree of your tableware. Lower and upper spray arms offers 360° rotating powerful cleaning, effectively remove oil stains on each pot and pans, don't leave any water stains. 🎁【2 Water Supply Modes】 The small dishwasher offers 2 water supply modes, including water tank supply and faucet supply. The dishwasher has a built-in 7.5-liter water tank, which can be used when filled with water in anywhere. There is also an inlet pipe connected to your faucet for direct water supply. You can choose a water supply mode as you needed. 🎁【Easy To Use】This mini dishwasher countertop is controlled by touch screen with indicator lights, when you install a drain pipe, the effluent will be automatically drain through the pipe. Hold the button for more than three seconds until the digital signal is displayed, and the child-lock function will be started to operate, keep your families safety. 🎁【Excellent Customer Service】Backed by an Gasland Chef Basics 1-year limited warranty. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b4l8-8N5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GASLAND","source_asin":"B091Y1HZ4B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Y1HZ4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Y1HZ4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
