window.products.push({"id":110091,"name":"Mini Fridge with Freezer, 4.5 Cu.Ft Compact Refrigerator with freezer, 2 Door Mini Fridge with freezer, Upright for Dorm, Bedroom, Office, Apartment- ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619AeeJQbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Is the powerful fridge you've been looking for? If you want the quiet mini fridge ultimately, it's recommended you go for our fridges. They use Automatic noise reduction compressors. The our Mini Fridge is an absorption mini-refrigerator that keeps the noise levels to the lowest levels.We engineered a whisper-quiet compressor，which makes it perfect for dorm rooms, offices, RVs, and other spaces that require quiet operation. Lock the air conditioner-keep food fresh. The temperature difference between the top and the bottom of the cabinet is small, the temperature is more uniform, the air conditioner is not wasted, the food becomes cold quickly and evenly, and the our mini fridge saves energy and electricity, locks in nutrition and keeps it fresh.It has a manual defrost feature to get rid of ice and two quick freeze shelves that allow flash refrigeration of certain food items. Let’s face it: the office can be a stressful environment. Workplace competition is aggravating enough — nobody wants to deal with in-fighting over the last yogurt in the break room fridge. That’s why a strategically hidden mini fridge, is an absolute must for any office worker with hopes of maintaining their sanity through lunch. What is better than having a space to call your own friend on the weekend? How about a cold beer to go along with the relaxation time? To keep a good supply of refreshments in your cave, any dedicated beer fridge will be small enough to fit in tight spaces. If you want to keep snacks and other non-alcoholic refreshments cool, however, a general mini-fridge with some space for a few cans or bottles may be the better investment. How about a cold beer to go along with the relaxation time? To keep a good supply of refreshments in your cave, any dedicated beer fridge will be small enough to fit in tight spaces. Student will greatly appreciate having the ability to keep sodas and sna","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619AeeJQbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HICER","source_asin":"B08K8X8C3V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8X8C3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8X8C3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":110092,"name":"Washing Machine Drain Hose Holder, Adjustable Drain Hose Holder Clamp Hook 304 Stainless Steel Hose Guide Clip Fits All Drain Hose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V1juBeKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Washing machine washer drain hose holder can well control the position of the drain, control the direction of water flow, stable and firm. It perfectly solves your washing machine drainage problem and gives you a clean and tidy environment. Hose guide clip opening is flexible and adjustable, the shape can be adjusted as needed, compatible with all washing machine hoses on the market, the two included rolling bands can help to better fix the position and can be freely matched depending on the situation. Made of 304 stainless steel, the sink hose clamp is non-corrosive, rust-free and sturdy enough to last even in wet bathroom or laundry room environments, perfect for the task of draining water. Easy to install: Simply place the drain holder on the edge of the sink, thread the outlet pipe through, and secure it with a tie if needed. It can be easily installed on the edge of the sink and effectively holds the washing machine plumbing in the ideal position to control the flow of water. How long is the warranty/renew? We offer a hassle-free 12-month warranty and 24-hour friendly customer service. If there is any dissatisfaction with the product, or the parts are missing, please contact us at any time, whether it is a new one or a refund, we will definitely give you a satisfactory answer. Be responsible for your choice, let you place an order with peace of mind~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V1juBeKqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mellbree","source_asin":"B0BPY47X2R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPY47X2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPY47X2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
