window.products.push({"id":110152,"name":"Portable Washer, Full Automatic Washing Machine with Drain Pump 8 Wash Programs & Child Lock, Laundry Machine Ideal for Home Apartment Dorm, 1.8 Cu.ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JDCzX5OwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧦2 in 1 Washer & Spin Dryer Combo: Designed with a fully automatic system, equipped with a single cylinder and a drain pump, the washing machine can be used not only for washing clothes, but also for drying. And washing and drying can be used separately. You just need to set the washing/spinning program, and it can work alone. The washer comes with an extension drain hose and a drain pump to help your washer drain easily and quickly. 🧦8 Wash Programs: This portable washer contains 8 programs, namely: Standard, Spin, Quick, Soak, Gentle, Air Dry, Retain Water, and Clean. The combination of multiple programs can make your clothes cleaner and softer. In general, these 8 programs can better meet our needs in different situations. 🧦Compact Size & High Capacity: This portable washing machine has a capacity of up to 12 lbs. You can put multiple pieces of clothing at the same time at one time. The appearance of this automatic washing machine is very compact. It is designed for small rooms and does not take up too much space. It can fully meet your needs. In general, it can save you space and energy. 🧦Child Lock Protection: This clothes washing machine has a child lock function, which can be triggered by pressing the \"program\" and \"water level\" buttons at the same time. Except for the power button, all buttons fail and an alarm will sound when the lid is opened, which greatly protects the safety of children. Moreover, the washing process will not be interrupted! 🧦Humanized Design: This compact laundry washer contains an \"air dry\" button, press this switch after washing the clothes. The inner barrel will rotate at a high speed to generate strong wind, which can keep the inner barrel dry. Press the \"cleaning\" button, this washing machine will form an ultra-high-speed driving water flow to wash the inner and outer barrel walls and easily wash away the remaining stains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JDCzX5OwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B0BRQCPZHW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRQCPZHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRQCPZHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
