window.products.push({"id":110168,"name":"Waterdrop DA29-00003G Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Samsung DA29-00003G, DA29-00003B, DA29-00003A, Aqua-Pure Plus, HAFCU1, RFG237AARS, FM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqTlNiCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Waterdrop DA29-00003G refrigerator water filter replacement, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this replacement for Samsung water filter HAFCU1 is effective against various materials. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. This replacement for DA29-00003G fridge water filter effectively filters off impurities from your water. While these chlorine, taste, odor, and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept. [Perfect fit] Waterdrop combines precision measurement technology to perfectly reproduce the original scale parameters with advanced industrial automation equipment. We aim to produce 100%-fit refrigerator filters with an exquisite engineering design, unlike inferior replacement filters that have issues with water leakage. Also, we strive to save your precious time by offering tool-free, no-mess refrigerator filter replacement. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. [Fresh-tasting water] The 100% natural coconut shell carbon block can adsorb more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterdrop refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to bring you a unique experience. [Monthly install stickers] Far from achieving high-standard filtration performance, expired replacement filters might cause pollutants to accumulate. Our complimentary set of monthly install stickers allows you to keep track of the filter’s lifespan. The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons, which will vary based on the water conditions. [Be responsible for each product] Each product, or even a small component manufactured by Waterdrop, must pass an extremely high-standard examination to reach the top requirements on the market. These standards don’t end once the filter leaves our factory. Waterdrop will take full responsibility for each filter. Our 24/7 customer service team will provide a water purification solution at any time. [Purified with love] We believe everyone, wherever they are, has the right to drink pure water. We hope to use what benefits us to benefit more people. For every purchase, we donate clean water to children in water-scarce regions in Africa. [Replacement for multiple models] Samsung DA29-00003G, Aqua-Pure Plus, DA29-00003A, DA97-06317A, RF267AERS, HAFIN2, FMS-1, RF268ABRS, DA61-00159, DA29-00003D, HAFCU1/XAA, HAFIN2/EXP, DA29-00003, DA29-00003A-B, DA61-00159A, DA61-00159A-B, DA61-159, AP4444333. [Replacement for multiple models] WF-DA29-00003G, RWF1010, RWF1100A, GF-03G, PL-700, CWMF022, EFF-6011A, FL-RF11, AQF-FF11B, WS611B, MB-F11B, WF289, CLCH103.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SqTlNiCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0BVZ6NRP6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZ6NRP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZ6NRP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
