window.products.push({"id":110286,"name":"AIEVE 2 Pack Reusable Coffee Pods Compatible with Ninja Dual Brew Coffee Maker, Reusable Coffee Filters K Cup for Ninja Coffee Maker CFP201 CFP301 Dua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mBLEwlVyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"An Excellent Gift for Coffee Lovers -- Upgraded k cup reusable coffee pods can be taken out more easily and fits perfectly with your coffee machine. The fine mesh on the reusable coffee filters increases the extraction time of the coffee, making the coffee more intense and delicious. It is compatible with Ninja coffee maker CFP201, CFP301, CFP400 Dual Brew Pro System. Unique Leaf-like Designs -- Aieve Reusable K cups filter are made of 304 stainless steel mesh and food grade PP, BPA free. It's smooth without ridge, which doesn't hide coffee grounds. Making cleanup a breeze. The special leaf design of the mesh symbolizes green life and decreases waste. 🚩WARM TIPS -- Do not remove the BREW BASKET on the coffee machine to avoid spilling. It can control the single hole outflow of coffee. After brewing, please open the lid and wait for 1-2 minutes. Sustainability Concept -- 1 billion trees are cut down every year to make disposable coffee filters and coffee pods, which is not easy to deal with. If you are willing to change the brewing tools, Aieve coffee filter can keep the original flavor of coffee while cutting down deforestation and resource waste. Recyclable and Affordable -- You will get 2 pack reusable coffee pods to make different flavors of coffee for your family and friends. Two coffee filters allow you to load coffee powder in advance, shortening the brewing time. It can also brew all kinds of hot cocoa, tea and scented tea, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mBLEwlVyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIEVE","source_asin":"B0BL987DCR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL987DCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL987DCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
