window.products.push({"id":110363,"name":"64 Oz Ball Mason Jar Cold Brew Coffee Maker - Iced Tea or Fruit Infuser - Cold Brew System & Kit Stainless Steel Filter, Lid & Silicone Seal For Coars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41whw9aa7VL._AC_.jpg","description":"Made of high quality food grade materials, this cold brew coffee maker will yield the purest, most flavorful beverage you'll ever make in just a few simple steps: Step 1: Add coarse ground coffee to basket and fill with water Step 2: Seal and shake a couple of times and allow to steep in your fridge for 12-24 hours, or even up to 48 hours for a richer tasteStep 3: Remove coffee ground and serve as is on iceYou can add cream or any flavor you usually put in your regular coffeeWhen you brew your coffee the usual way (hot brew), you will surely smell the aroma in the air. That definitely smells good. Butthat also means so much aroma has already escaped your beverage. With this cold brew coffee maker, you can be sure no aromaticflavor escapes until you are ready to enjoy your drink. It is prepared cold from start to finish and then served cold to keep yourbeverage flavorful to the last dropAdvantages of the cold brew process: Simple to prepare Simple to prepare No expensive/complex equipment needed No expensive/complex equipment needed No heat involved No heat involved Makes less acidic yet more flavorful coffee Makes less acidic yet more flavorful coffee This cold brew kit is designed primarily for coffee, but you can also use it as tea infuser, herb / fruit infuser and also for steepedoil recipes. Just put your favorite flavor into the fine mesh stainless steel filter, immerse it in the 2 quart wide mouth mason jarwith adequate water / oil, put on the air tight lid and let it steep for 12-24 hours (steeped oil may take longer) and be impressed by the best tasting beverage or gourmet oil you never thought you could makeAdvantages of using Breanas Home Barista’s cold brew coffee maker: Simple Simple No heat involved No heat involved Sealed in flavor Sealed in flavor Durable Durable Made of high quality food grade materials Made of high quality food grade materials Easy to use Easy to use Easy to clean Easy to clean So, Indulge yourself with the best tasting brewed coffee with this 2 quart cold brew kit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41whw9aa7VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Breana’s Home Barista","source_asin":"B076895L5T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076895L5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B076895L5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
