window.products.push({"id":110771,"name":"Spider For Samsung Washer DC60-40137A Samsung Washer Parts Spider SAM-DC60-40137A Hex Bolt AP4203183 2068605 PS4205366 (6-Pack) - Fits For DC97-15491A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YhLQiW27S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dc60-40137a Washer Spider Bolt - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4203183, 2068605, PS4205366. These bolts are for the inner tub flange and shaft assembly. Dc60-40137a Washing Machine Spider Hex Bolt is compatible with Kenmore and Samsung washer parts. Hex bolts fit hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. It is designed to securely fasten various parts of the washer together, ensuring stability and proper functioning of the appliance. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. DC60-40137A Washer Hex Bolt will help if your appliance is noisy, the inner tub went out of balance, and there's a need to replace a spider arm assembly. It is crucial to obtain the correct replacement part, such as the ours, to ensure compatibility and proper functioning of the washing machine. 💡 The main purpose of the Dc60-40137a Spider Hex Bolt is to hold different components of the washing machine securely in place. It is commonly used to fasten the drum assembly, motor, pump, and other essential parts of the washer. The hex head bolt is typically made of durable materials, that ensure the bolt's longevity. Samsung Dc60-40137a Replacement Spider Hex Bolts meet or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 To install the Washer Bolt Dc60-40137a, you will need a suitable wrench or socket tool that matches the size of the bolt head. The Dc60-40137a Washer Hex Bolt is threaded into the designated hole and tightened securely until the components are held firmly together. It is essential not to overtighten the bolt, as this can cause damage to the washer's parts. 💡 Are the washer hex head bolts universal? No, washer hex head bolts are not universal. They come in various sizes, lengths, and thread patterns to fit specific appliances and their components. It's crucial to use the correct hex head bolt that matches the specifications provided by the manufacturer for your specific washer model. Using the wrong size or type of hex head bolt can result in improper fit, instability, and potential damage to the appliance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YhLQiW27S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07VK3WSR8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VK3WSR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VK3WSR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
