window.products.push({"id":110879,"name":"HiWater 24 Packs Coffee Filters Discs Compatible with Mr Coffee Filter Replacement Charcoal Water Filter Discs Filter for Mr Coffee Brewers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+AgyhT8hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBILITY: These Mr. Coffee compatible filters made by HiWater will fit all Mr. Coffee coffee makers that take the disc style of charcoal filter.  Fits any 4-12 cup brewer, even if it's not listed here. Easy to Install 1. Always unplug your unit before changing any parts. 2. Open the top, move aside this bar and lift out the top piece, turn it over and slide the old filter out. 3. Grab your HiWater branded replacement filter. 4. Slide it into the three braces and this handy tab can be set to the months that you changed it, so you can remember when to change it next. 5. Gently place the filter back into the coffeemaker and close the top that¡¯s it you¡¯re ready to make coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+AgyhT8hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HiWater","source_asin":"B07J5KV125","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5KV125","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5KV125","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":110880,"name":"SOOPYK Ice Makers Countertop, Portable Ice Makes 27 lbs in 24 hrs - 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 5-7 Mins, Ice Maker Machine with Self- Cleaning Function with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613k1068L8S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍺 MORE EFFICIENT AND FAST: ice makers countertop takes about (5-7 minutes) per batch of ice. 1.8 L Water Capacity - each (5-7 minutes) cycle makes 9 ice cubes with the capacity to make up to 27 lbs in 24 hours. When unused ice melts, the machines will automatically recycle the water to make a new batch of ice. 🍻 QUIET AND ENERGY SAVING EFFICIENT ICE MAKERS: SOOPYK ice makers adopt a powerful compressor with a thicker 26g/R600a refrigerant, which makes the ice-making process quick and quiet (＜40db)It can get better cooling, lower noise, and lower energy consumption. 🥂 SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION: Pour water into ice makers, Plugin power press the power button for 3 seconds, It will start to self-cleaning - the pump pumps water into the ice-making box, repeat for 10 mins, then recover to standby mode. You need to drain the water tank and refill, then start making ice.SOOPYK ice maker can be cleaned automatically and make more pure ice cubes. This ice machine is suitable for teens, adults, and grandparents. 🍦 COMPACT ICE MAKER FOR COUNTERTOP: SOOPYK ice maker takes up less counter space than most portable ice makers, and it’s lighter and easier to lift. The underside drain plug makes it easier to empty after use, too. 🥤 WIDE APPLICATIONS: Our portable ice makers(countertop ice makers) are best suited for RVs or boats, camping, bar, tea shop, KTV, kitchen and office, or tailgating—situations where you want ice but you’re near neither a fridge nor a cooler filled with store-bought ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613k1068L8S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOOPYK","source_asin":"B08T5M5MF6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T5M5MF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T5M5MF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
