window.products.push({"id":110885,"name":"Stylish Dishwasher Magnet Clean Dirty Sign - Ideal Clean Dirty Magnet for Dishwasher - Kitchen Organizer and Gadget - Nice Office, Home Farmhouse Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJbP408HL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"🍴 IDEAL SIGNAGE ACCESSORIES FOR KITCHEN AND LAUNDRY ROOM ORGANIZATION: Our dishwasher magnet clearly highlights if the dishwasher, washing or laundry machine is clean or dirty ensuring dirty dishes don't get mixed with clean dishes and people empty the dishwasher in a timely fashion. 🍵PROMOTE GOOD HABITS: Our clean or dirty dishwasher magnet is a cool and fun way to teach the children from a young age to empty the dishwasher and put away the pots, pans, and plates forming healthy habits from a young age! Better yet, you can use it to encourage your housemates or better half to put the dishes away, creating a healthy dishwashing cycle. 🍷 COMPATIBLE WITH ALL DISHWASHERS: The 7 x 2 inch dishwasher sign is made with super strong magnets to ensure it does not slip off your dishwasher and comes with two small double-sided adhesives which you will need if your dishwasher does not have a metal door. 🎉 NICE DECORATION: The cute clean/dirty dishwasher magnet has a lovely look that adds a nice decorative touch to any home. On the left of the sign \"DIRTY\" is displayed on a red background and when you slide the sign over to the right you will see the \"CLEAN\" side is a green color ensuring each side is easily identifiable from a distance. ☕ EASY TO APPLY AND USE: If your dishwasher door is stainless steel simply apply the magnet directly to the dishwasher appliance or if it is nonmagnetic such as wooden use the strong double-sided adhesives. Then use the slider to indicate dirty or clean depending on the status of the dish washer at that moment in time. 🍻 LIFETIME WARRANTY: TEST IT AND YOU WILL LOVE IT. If for any reason you don’t we offer a replacement for free at any time, no questions asked + 30-day money-back guarantee. Lastly, enjoy our dishwasher clean dirty magnet sign, and thank you for choosing Assured Signs. :) 🎁😊 THOUGHTFUL GIFT - The magnet is a great gift for Mother’s Day, New Homes or Apartments, Housewarmings or as a stocking stuffer for Christmas. It's a simple and practical kitchen decoration for your mom, wife, grandparents or girlfriend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJbP408HL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASSURED SIGNS","source_asin":"B0C94VM8NS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-110885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C94VM8NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C94VM8NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
